  <h2>Gestures</h2>
  <p>A gesture moves an element with the pointer, and each one has a keyboard alternative, so the page works without a pointer. Define a gesture once, from <code>@udixio/motion/gesture</code>, and mark the element with <code>data-motion-gesture="&lt;name&gt;"</code>. A drag follows the pointer and glides on when it is released. A swipe flies its element out past 40 % of its size, or at more than 800 px/s, and tells the page. A reorder moves an item among its siblings and announces each step to assistive technology.</p>
